flowchart LR
 Human[Owner names slow operation] --> Ramsey[RAMsey: capacity and protected work]
 Ramsey --> Coordinator[Assistant: explicit handoff]
 Coordinator --> QS[QuickSilver: measure one bottleneck]
 QS --> Fix[Smallest proposed fix]
 Fix --> Approval[Production needs explicit approval]
 Fix --> Proof[Same-workload latency remeasurement]
 Proof --> Ramsey
 Ramsey --> Resource[Separate resource comparison]
